{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_04_end",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_04",
  "title": "勇敢，莽撞",
  "storyCode": "MB-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1cffbfd940c000546a966aea64d32a218ef6a87e8a9ca3c9aab76d2dd746a634",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "所以，和卡夫卡的認識有什麼問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "不，不是和卡夫卡的認識有問題。而是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "和卡夫卡認識之後，我一直希望她能夠過上正常的生活，不要再做以前那些見不得光的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "我給她介紹了一些我能介紹的工作，甚至想要讓她成為萊茵生命的一員，雖然最後失敗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "但無論如何，我始終希望卡夫卡能夠過上更好的生活，我希望她變好。而這個好，是以我在萊茵生命的生活作為標準的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "嗯......我覺得在萊茵生命的生活確實還不賴呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "前提是我們不知道自己在做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#1",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "可是作為科研工作者，我們不是應該非常清楚自己在做什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "不，我不是指科研上的目的，而是那背後的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "我們的研究如果真的成功會帶來什麼影響；我們的成果會被用來做什麼；這是不是現在的我們應該研究的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "在“炎魔”之後，公司內部發生的一些事情讓我開始考慮這個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "我像你，像大部分同事一樣，認為我們的研究是正確的，我們的方向是理想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "但真的是這樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "伊芙利特讓我對這些事情產生了懷疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "這種懷疑促使我暫時離開了萊茵生命，前往了羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#1",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "原來赫默你一直在想這樣的事情啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "在羅德島的時間裡，我一方面在進行科研工作，另一方面，我開始關注起過去沒有在意過的一些資料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "這些資料是老師給我的，我以前並不明白他將一些公司和地方的資料交給我是為了什麼，我也都丟在了一邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "但是隨著對這些資料的分析和研究，我才發現了其中存在著各種各樣的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "第一次發現其中問題的那一天，我徹夜未眠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "你是指和安東尼有關的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "不，安東尼，或者說西蒙公司的事只是其中一部分，甚至只是一小部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "還有很多一樣的事情在發生著，不只是在萊茵生命，是在哥倫比亞之中發生著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "那時我才真正意識到，我對萊茵生命這家公司，對哥倫比亞這個國家都瞭解得太少了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "但我不甘心，我不覺得發生在伊芙利特身上的事，發生在安東尼身上的事應該是正常的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "所以我才會想要插手安東尼這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "但是，我或許步伐邁得太大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "我現在的感覺和那一天一樣，塞雷婭從試驗場地將昏迷的伊芙利特抱出來時，仿佛被人從頭澆了一盆冰水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#1",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "那次實驗究竟發生了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "誒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "我一直以為我知道我在做什麼，但我現在才發現，我其實不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "我只知道，我絕不能讓伊芙利特再被那樣對待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "這可能，是我現在唯一能夠堅持的事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#1",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "......赫默，你有些醉了，我去給你倒點醒酒茶吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#1",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "對不起，赫默，我不知道怎麼安慰你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "這不怪你，梅爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "我只怪我自己過去太無知了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "我覺得赫默你已經知道得很多了，只是大家都有不擅長的領域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "但是，梅爾，我是真的不甘心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "如果我能知道得更多一些，如果我能知道得更早一些，或許事情不會變成現在這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "但是現在開始知道也來得及呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "我覺得繆爾賽思主任應該也覺得你挺厲害的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "我說實話哦，赫默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "你說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "我感覺赫默你現在有些像我一些同事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "就是在知道了一些新的知識後，就覺得自己過去學的一點用都沒有，然後開始哀歎自己為什麼沒有早點遇上這門學問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "不是說這樣就不對啦，但是我覺得這樣就很沒意思，難道以前努力過的東西真的就沒用了嗎？新的東西就一定好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "如果它真的好，如果真的覺得它有用，那麼用和以前一樣的努力去學習它不就好了，沒有什麼好著急的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "來，喝了這杯醒酒茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "不是你說的那樣，這些事情和學問不一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "但是，但是你說的也有道理，確實......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "哎呀，算了，我來餵你喝吧，真是的，赫默你酒量不行呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "怎麼樣，感覺好點沒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "嘶......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "好多了，謝謝你，梅爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "要是你感覺不好受的話，要不然我們直接回去吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "......不，還不到那個時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "你還要繼續和繆爾賽思主任聊天嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerToken": "char_242_mayer#2",
      "operatorId": "char_242_mayer",
      "portraitKey": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "不愧是赫默，這麼快就調整好了心態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "......其實完全沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "雖然我也很想就這麼逃開，現在立刻回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "但是這次機會很難得，即使我再難受，我也必須要堅持到最後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "你剛才說的話，雖然無法解決我現在的問題，不過有一點我認為很對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "我只能用和以前一樣的努力去學習和接受這些新的“知識”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerToken": "char_108_silent_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_108_silent",
      "portraitKey": "char_108_silent",
      "text": "不過，我也要做一些額外的準備。"
    },
